RootRegistry::_removeRoot
├── given the scheme is not installed
│   └── when removing it
│       └── it should revert with RootNotInstalled
├── given exactly one scheme is installed
│   └── when removing that last scheme
│       └── it should revert with CannotRemoveLastRoot
└── given two schemes are installed
    └── when removing one of them
        ├── it should uninstall that scheme (not installed, credential cleared)
        ├── it should keep the other scheme installed
        └── it should emit RootValidatorUninstalled
